<title>USA: Wireless Telecom sees 96 sales of $22.4 mln.</title>
<headline>Wireless Telecom sees 96 sales of $22.4 mln.</headline>
<dateline>PARAMUS, N.J. 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wireless Telecom Group Inc said on Thursday that it expects to record 1996 sales of about $22.4 million.</p>
<p>The figure is an increase from the sales last year of $16 million.</p>
<p>The company said the fourth-quarter incoming orders were encouraging, yielding a book-to-bill ratio exceeding 1.2. Year-end sales and earnings will be posted in early February, Wireless Telecom said.</p>
</text>
